      "message": "Would anything bad happen if we just used `CBUILD`? That seems a little easier to follow.\n```\nifeq ($(CBUILD),)\nCBUILD\u003dx86_64-pc-linux-gnu\nendif\n...\ncc-name:\u003d$(... $(CBUILD)-$(CC) ...)\n...\nBUILD_CC\u003d$(CBUILD)-$(cc-name)\n```\nI think you\u0027d still want to retain the comment explaining the Portage variables.",
